{"id":"vol9-03","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-03/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":337.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":2.7,"text":"Now turn to Section 2 on page 4.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.24],["turn",0.24,0.54],["to",0.54,0.78],["Section",0.78,1.04],["2",1.04,1.54],["on",1.54,1.92],["page",1.92,2.18],["4.",2.18,2.7]]},{"start":5.27,"end":12.35,"text":"Section 2. You will hear a program on a student radio station. It describes the findings of","words":[["Section",5.27,5.49],["2.",5.49,6.01],["You",6.91,7.17],["will",7.17,7.31],["hear",7.31,7.45],["a",7.45,7.61],["program",7.61,8.05],["on",8.05,8.37],["a",8.37,8.51],["student",8.51,8.83],["radio",8.83,9.31],["station.",9.31,9.89],["It",10.75,10.95],["describes",10.95,11.29],["the",11.29,11.67],["findings",11.67,12.01],["of",12.01,12.35]]},{"start":12.35,"end":16.77,"text":"a survey on vacation jobs taken by students the previous year.","words":[["a",12.35,12.47],["survey",12.47,12.83],["on",12.83,13.21],["vacation",13.21,13.61],["jobs",13.61,14.25],["taken",14.25,14.83],["by",14.83,15.13],["students",15.13,15.63],["the",15.63,15.91],["previous",15.91,16.25],["year.",16.25,16.77]]},{"start":17.95,"end":45.57,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16 on page 4. Now listen carefully and","words":[["First",17.95,18.37],["you",18.37,18.59],["have",18.59,18.75],["some",18.75,18.93],["time",18.93,19.25],["to",19.25,19.47],["look",19.47,19.61],["at",19.61,19.77],["questions",19.77,20.17],["11",20.17,21.07],["to",21.07,21.51],["16",21.51,22.05],["on",22.05,22.85],["page",22.85,23.09],["4.",23.09,23.57],["Now",43.85,44.19],["listen",44.19,44.51],["carefully",44.51,44.97],["and",44.97,45.57]]},{"start":45.57,"end":47.71,"text":"answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["answer",45.57,45.85],["questions",45.85,46.29],["11",46.29,47.01],["to",47.01,47.29],["16.",47.29,47.71]]},{"start":47.71,"end":56.77,"text":"Welcome to Student Life. It's spring and many of you may be thinking about","words":[["Welcome",47.71,48.83],["to",51.97,52.49],["Student",52.49,52.87],["Life.",52.87,53.33],["It's",53.85,54.15],["spring",54.15,54.45],["and",54.45,55.17],["many",55.17,55.49],["of",55.49,55.69],["you",55.69,55.83],["may",55.83,56.05],["be",56.05,56.21],["thinking",56.21,56.45],["about",56.45,56.77]]},{"start":56.77,"end":62.69,"text":"arranging work for the long vacation. So on today's program, Roger Enwell reports on","words":[["arranging",56.77,57.19],["work",57.19,57.57],["for",57.57,57.81],["the",57.81,57.91],["long",57.91,58.17],["vacation.",58.17,58.63],["So",59.27,59.51],["on",59.51,59.75],["today's",59.75,60.21],["program,",60.21,60.69],["Roger",61.27,61.49],["Enwell",61.49,62.01],["reports",62.01,62.41],["on",62.41,62.69]]},{"start":62.69,"end":67.49,"text":"a survey we conducted into the pleasures and problems of vacation jobs. Roger.","words":[["a",62.69,62.83],["survey",62.83,63.17],["we",63.17,63.45],["conducted",63.45,63.89],["into",63.89,64.21],["the",64.21,64.39],["pleasures",64.39,64.77],["and",64.77,65.13],["problems",65.13,65.57],["of",65.57,65.89],["vacation",65.89,66.25],["jobs.",66.25,66.81],["Roger.",67.11,67.49]]},{"start":68.35,"end":73.05,"text":"Thank you Sarah. Well the first thing to say is that by far the majority of","words":[["Thank",68.35,68.69],["you",68.69,68.77],["Sarah.",68.77,68.97],["Well",69.79,70.19],["the",70.19,70.73],["first",70.73,70.89],["thing",70.89,71.05],["to",71.05,71.15],["say",71.15,71.39],["is",71.39,71.59],["that",71.59,71.75],["by",71.75,71.95],["far",71.95,72.33],["the",72.33,72.45],["majority",72.45,72.77],["of",72.77,73.05]]},{"start":73.05,"end":77.81,"text":"students we surveyed did just three types of jobs. All of these obviously had","words":[["students",73.05,73.33],["we",73.33,73.65],["surveyed",73.65,74.23],["did",74.23,74.51],["just",74.51,74.79],["three",74.79,75.13],["types",75.13,75.49],["of",75.49,75.61],["jobs.",75.61,75.89],["All",76.57,76.87],["of",76.87,76.99],["these",76.99,77.17],["obviously",77.17,77.51],["had",77.51,77.81]]},{"start":77.81,"end":84.39,"text":"their advantages and disadvantages. Starting with stock taking in supermarkets. The thing","words":[["their",77.81,77.95],["advantages",77.95,78.41],["and",78.41,78.99],["disadvantages.",78.99,79.35],["Starting",80.71,81.23],["with",81.23,81.47],["stock",81.47,81.77],["taking",81.77,82.17],["in",82.17,82.39],["supermarkets.",82.39,82.99],["The",83.77,84.23],["thing",84.23,84.39]]},{"start":84.39,"end":88.61,"text":"that students said they enjoyed most about this job was the travelling. They were often","words":[["that",84.39,84.55],["students",84.55,84.79],["said",84.79,85.11],["they",85.11,85.25],["enjoyed",85.25,85.51],["most",85.51,85.77],["about",85.77,86.01],["this",86.01,86.23],["job",86.23,86.47],["was",86.47,86.93],["the",86.93,87.07],["travelling.",87.07,87.37],["They",88.19,88.33],["were",88.33,88.43],["often",88.43,88.61]]},{"start":88.61,"end":93.35,"text":"required to go to branches to do their stock takes and this was regarded as an interesting","words":[["required",88.61,88.95],["to",88.95,89.21],["go",89.21,89.31],["to",89.31,89.41],["branches",89.41,89.77],["to",89.77,90.13],["do",90.13,90.27],["their",90.27,90.47],["stock",90.47,90.77],["takes",90.77,91.09],["and",91.09,91.85],["this",91.85,91.99],["was",91.99,92.13],["regarded",92.13,92.55],["as",92.55,92.95],["an",92.95,93.09],["interesting",93.09,93.35]]},{"start":93.35,"end":99.17,"text":"plus. The main negative, however, was that they tended to find the job tiring with long","words":[["plus.",93.35,93.71],["The",94.77,95.01],["main",95.01,95.21],["negative,",95.21,95.67],["however,",95.75,96.03],["was",96.51,96.69],["that",96.69,96.79],["they",96.79,96.91],["tended",96.91,97.15],["to",97.15,97.33],["find",97.33,97.53],["the",97.53,97.67],["job",97.67,97.91],["tiring",97.91,98.49],["with",98.49,98.89],["long",98.89,99.17]]},{"start":99.17,"end":104.25,"text":"hours spent on their feet and climbing high shelves. Now, one thing we did ask the","words":[["hours",99.17,99.49],["spent",99.49,99.75],["on",99.75,99.97],["their",99.97,100.13],["feet",100.13,100.37],["and",100.37,100.69],["climbing",100.69,101.01],["high",101.01,101.35],["shelves.",101.35,101.69],["Now,",102.57,102.77],["one",103.05,103.31],["thing",103.31,103.47],["we",103.47,103.61],["did",103.61,103.85],["ask",103.85,104.11],["the",104.11,104.25]]},{"start":104.25,"end":108.77,"text":"students in our survey was whether they had any recommendations for other people taking","words":[["students",104.25,104.55],["in",104.55,104.73],["our",104.73,104.87],["survey",104.87,105.19],["was",105.19,105.93],["whether",105.93,106.17],["they",106.17,106.35],["had",106.35,106.53],["any",106.53,106.73],["recommendations",106.73,107.29],["for",107.29,107.83],["other",107.83,108.01],["people",108.01,108.37],["taking",108.37,108.77]]},{"start":108.77,"end":114.95,"text":"on their job, and they said, perhaps not surprisingly, get good shoes. That's the only way you can","words":[["on",108.77,109.03],["their",109.03,109.21],["job,",109.21,109.51],["and",109.97,110.27],["they",110.27,110.39],["said,",110.39,110.61],["perhaps",110.75,110.95],["not",110.95,111.21],["surprisingly,",111.21,111.79],["get",112.43,112.69],["good",112.69,113.01],["shoes.",113.01,113.47],["That's",114.19,114.39],["the",114.39,114.47],["only",114.47,114.55],["way",114.55,114.73],["you",114.73,114.85],["can",114.85,114.95]]},{"start":114.95,"end":115.43,"text":"keep going.","words":[["keep",114.95,115.11],["going.",115.11,115.43]]},{"start":116.61,"end":122.59,"text":"Another job which lots of students did was office work, and the positive feature of this actually","words":[["Another",116.61,117.21],["job",117.21,117.59],["which",117.59,117.83],["lots",117.83,118.03],["of",118.03,118.21],["students",118.21,118.45],["did",118.45,118.81],["was",118.81,119.33],["office",119.33,119.69],["work,",119.69,119.99],["and",120.63,120.95],["the",120.95,121.03],["positive",121.03,121.33],["feature",121.33,121.69],["of",121.69,121.89],["this",121.89,122.11],["actually",122.11,122.59]]},{"start":122.59,"end":128.25,"text":"rather surprised me, until I remembered what a hot summer it was last year. Lots of","words":[["rather",122.59,122.95],["surprised",122.95,123.33],["me,",123.33,123.73],["until",124.13,124.49],["I",124.49,124.67],["remembered",124.67,124.95],["what",124.95,125.35],["a",125.35,125.49],["hot",125.49,125.67],["summer",125.67,125.97],["it",125.97,126.17],["was",126.17,126.31],["last",126.31,126.59],["year.",126.59,126.89],["Lots",127.69,128.11],["of",128.11,128.25]]},{"start":128.25,"end":133.35,"text":"students named air conditioning as the best thing about office work. The downside which","words":[["students",128.25,128.51],["named",128.51,128.89],["air",128.89,129.37],["conditioning",129.37,129.83],["as",129.83,130.05],["the",130.05,130.17],["best",130.17,130.37],["thing",130.37,130.53],["about",130.53,130.73],["office",130.73,131.05],["work.",131.05,131.39],["The",132.27,132.51],["downside",132.51,132.89],["which",132.89,133.35]]},{"start":133.35,"end":138.91,"text":"many talked about was wearing formal clothes. Obviously this didn't go down too well with","words":[["many",133.35,133.59],["talked",133.59,133.85],["about",133.85,134.17],["was",134.17,134.81],["wearing",134.81,135.21],["formal",135.21,135.71],["clothes.",135.71,136.27],["Obviously",137.09,137.49],["this",137.49,137.75],["didn't",137.75,137.95],["go",137.95,138.09],["down",138.09,138.31],["too",138.31,138.53],["well",138.53,138.75],["with",138.75,138.91]]},{"start":138.91,"end":144.97,"text":"students. The advice most people gave was to select a large office. That way you have","words":[["students.",138.91,139.21],["The",140.05,140.23],["advice",140.23,140.55],["most",140.55,140.81],["people",140.81,141.05],["gave",141.05,141.39],["was",141.39,141.95],["to",141.95,142.09],["select",142.09,142.37],["a",142.37,142.61],["large",142.61,142.89],["office.",142.89,143.39],["That",144.19,144.47],["way",144.47,144.67],["you",144.67,144.81],["have",144.81,144.97]]},{"start":144.97,"end":150.01,"text":"more variety of social contacts. Otherwise the work can get very boring.","words":[["more",144.97,145.15],["variety",145.15,145.61],["of",145.61,145.81],["social",145.81,146.09],["contacts.",146.09,146.67],["Otherwise",147.35,147.77],["the",147.77,148.41],["work",148.41,148.67],["can",148.67,149.03],["get",149.03,149.31],["very",149.31,149.59],["boring.",149.59,150.01]]},{"start":151.53,"end":156.37,"text":"The third job which had attracted large numbers of students was as a theme park attendant.","words":[["The",151.53,151.81],["third",151.81,152.07],["job",152.07,152.35],["which",152.35,152.55],["had",152.55,152.69],["attracted",152.69,153.05],["large",153.05,153.39],["numbers",153.39,153.73],["of",153.73,153.89],["students",153.89,154.23],["was",154.23,154.95],["as",154.95,155.31],["a",155.31,155.53],["theme",155.53,155.69],["park",155.69,156.03],["attendant.",156.03,156.37]]},{"start":156.87,"end":162.57,"text":"And again, I got a surprise here, because the big plus people talked about was good pay.","words":[["And",156.87,157.35],["again,",157.35,157.63],["I",158.01,158.25],["got",158.25,158.35],["a",158.35,158.45],["surprise",158.45,158.85],["here,",158.85,159.25],["because",159.45,159.91],["the",159.91,160.07],["big",160.07,160.29],["plus",160.29,160.63],["people",160.63,160.95],["talked",160.95,161.29],["about",161.29,161.61],["was",161.61,161.97],["good",161.97,162.23],["pay.",162.23,162.57]]},{"start":163.31,"end":165.65,"text":"It must have improved since my day, I must say.","words":[["It",163.31,163.79],["must",163.79,163.97],["have",163.97,164.07],["improved",164.07,164.39],["since",164.39,164.57],["my",164.57,164.87],["day,",164.87,165.09],["I",165.21,165.23],["must",165.23,165.33],["say.",165.33,165.65]]},{"start":166.47,"end":172.21,"text":"Anyway, the downside I did recognise, having to deal with difficult customers, especially","words":[["Anyway,",166.47,166.95],["the",167.45,167.63],["downside",167.63,168.03],["I",168.03,168.43],["did",168.43,168.57],["recognise,",168.57,169.09],["having",169.67,169.87],["to",169.87,170.03],["deal",170.03,170.21],["with",170.21,170.37],["difficult",170.37,170.75],["customers,",170.75,171.39],["especially",171.81,172.21]]},{"start":172.21,"end":175.03,"text":"in the heat when tempers get frayed, not easy.","words":[["in",172.21,172.43],["the",172.43,172.51],["heat",172.51,172.73],["when",172.73,172.89],["tempers",172.89,173.33],["get",173.33,173.47],["frayed,",173.47,173.87],["not",174.49,174.69],["easy.",174.69,175.03]]},{"start":175.77,"end":179.65,"text":"And people said that it was a good idea to live nearby, because there's a lot of","words":[["And",175.77,175.99],["people",175.99,176.23],["said",176.23,176.53],["that",176.53,176.67],["it",176.67,176.77],["was",176.77,176.87],["a",176.87,176.97],["good",176.97,177.13],["idea",177.13,177.47],["to",177.47,177.65],["live",177.65,177.93],["nearby,",177.93,178.43],["because",178.75,179.09],["there's",179.09,179.25],["a",179.25,179.33],["lot",179.33,179.51],["of",179.51,179.65]]},{"start":179.65,"end":183.25,"text":"shift work and you don't have to worry about transport at difficult times of the","words":[["shift",179.65,179.87],["work",179.87,180.23],["and",180.23,180.67],["you",180.67,180.75],["don't",180.75,180.89],["have",180.89,181.01],["to",181.01,181.07],["worry",181.07,181.31],["about",181.31,181.55],["transport",181.55,182.19],["at",182.19,182.43],["difficult",182.43,182.67],["times",182.67,183.05],["of",183.05,183.17],["the",183.17,183.25]]},{"start":183.25,"end":183.49,"text":"day.","words":[["day.",183.25,183.49]]},{"start":186.46,"end":193.0,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the program, you have some time to look at questions 17-20","words":[["Before",186.46,187.48],["you",187.48,187.74],["hear",187.74,187.9],["the",187.9,188.04],["rest",188.04,188.3],["of",188.3,188.42],["the",188.42,